{title: Naino Ki To Baat}
{artist: Altaf Sayyed}
{key: A#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#m] Naino ki to baat,        [F#] naina jaane [G#] hai
[G#] Sapno ke raaj to,        Raina jaane [A#m] hai
[A#m] Naino ki to baat,        [F#] naina jaane [G#] hai
[G#] Sapno ke raaj to,        Raina jaane [A#m] hai
[A#m] dil ki ye baatein,        Dhadkan [D#m] jaane hai
[G#] Jispe gujre wo,        [F#] tan [C#] jaane hai
[A#m] Hum deewa [D#m] ne,        Ho [A#m] gaye hai [G#] apke
Hum to [G#] bas itna [A#m] Jane hai.        Tu [A#m] mera hai sa [G#] nam
Tu hi [A#m] mera hum [G#] dum,        Tere [A#m] sang [G#] jeena
Ab [F#] saato [A#m] janam,        Tu [A#m] mera hai sa [G#] nam
Tu hi [A#m] mera hum [G#] dum,        Tere [A#m] sang [G#] jeena
Ab [F#] saato [A#m] janam,        [A#m] Nazrein ye [G#] apki
[F#] Karne lagi hos [F] yariyan [A#m],        [A#m] Kahi Kar de na [G#] ye
[F#] Mere liye dus [F] wariyaan [A#m],        [A#m] Nazrein ye [D#m] apki
[G#] Karne lagi hos [A#m] yariyan,        [A#m] Kahi Kar de na [G#] ye
[G#] Mere liye dus [A#m] wariyaan,        [A#m] Husn ki to baat
[F#] husn hi jaane [G#] hai,        [G#] Roop ki raaj to
Roop hi jaane [A#m] hai,        [A#m] Sahi galat to
darpan [D#] jaane hai,        [G#] Jispe gujre wo
[F#] tan jane [C#] hai,        [A#m] Hum deewa [D#m] ne
Ho [A#m] gaye hai [G#] apke,        Hum to [G#] bas itna [C#] Jane hai.
Tu [A#m] mera hai sa [G#] nam,        Tu hi [A#m] mera hum [G#] dum
Tere [A#m] sang [G#] jeena,        Ab [F#] saato [A#m] janam
Tu [A#m] mera hai sa [G#] nam,        Tu hi [A#m] mera hum [G#] dum
Tere [A#m] sang [G#] jeena,        Ab [F#] saato [A#m] janam
